WEBVTT

00:11.090 --> 00:13.070
<b><i>All fleets are reporting...</i></b>

00:13.070 --> 00:17.320
<b><i>their designation systems
via Permet links are all green.</i></b>

00:17.320 --> 00:18.990
<b>Commence attack.</b>

00:32.780 --> 00:34.800
<b><i>Enormous Lorentz force detected.</i></b>

00:34.800 --> 00:36.390
<b>Unable to confirm trajectory.</b>

00:36.390 --> 00:38.100
<b>Switch to guided missiles.</b>

00:52.690 --> 00:54.490
<b>They've been overridden.</b>

00:54.490 --> 00:55.700
<b>We can't control them!</b>

00:55.700 --> 00:57.720
<b>All ships, ready missile defenses!</b>

01:09.610 --> 01:12.680
<b>Contact lost with Almeida
from the second fleet.</b>

01:12.680 --> 01:17.660
<b>One-third of the ships
in the third fleet are inoperable.</b>

01:17.660 --> 01:19.300
<b>We'll retreat.</b>

01:20.410 --> 01:24.480
<b>It'll take some time to reactivate
the Permet reactor.</b>

01:25.330 --> 01:27.900
<b>Thank you, Eri...</b>

01:32.590 --> 01:35.240
<b>Miorine, it's me.</b>

01:39.560 --> 01:40.960
<b>I'll come back.</b>

03:18.650 --> 03:21.970
<b>Episode 22</b>

03:21.970 --> 03:24.890
<b>You want to borrow the Demi Barding again?</b>

03:24.890 --> 03:26.680
<b>Please! I'm begging you!</b>

03:27.490 --> 03:28.270
<b>Sure.</b>

03:28.270 --> 03:29.140
<b>Really?!</b>

03:29.140 --> 03:32.930
<b>But if you break it, it'll cost you.</b>

03:32.930 --> 03:35.570
<b>W-We could never pay that!</b>

03:35.570 --> 03:38.120
<b>It's for Suletta's sake! Don't wuss out!</b>

03:39.090 --> 03:40.740
<b>One more thing.</b>

03:40.740 --> 03:42.360
<b>Can you take Rouji with you?</b>

03:43.350 --> 03:44.700
<b>I'm pretty curious...</b>

03:44.700 --> 03:46.040
<b>about this.</b>

03:47.600 --> 03:50.420
<b>Here. This is the list
of animal care tasks.</b>

03:50.420 --> 03:52.590
<b>All this in one day?</b>

03:52.590 --> 03:55.680
<b>This is longer than a mobile craft manual.</b>

03:55.680 --> 03:56.840
<b>It is?</b>

03:56.840 --> 03:59.360
<b>Come on! What's one more person?</b>

03:59.360 --> 04:02.350
<b>Why don't you go with the Jeturk guys?</b>

04:02.350 --> 04:06.000
<b>Mr. Guel said I can't come yet.</b>

04:06.000 --> 04:06.840
<b>In that case--</b>

04:06.840 --> 04:09.920
<b>I can't just sit around down here!</b>

04:09.920 --> 04:12.570
<b>Things have livened up around here.</b>

04:12.570 --> 04:14.570
<b>Is she really going to pilot it?</b>

04:14.570 --> 04:16.320
<b>That Gundam called Calibarn...</b>

04:16.320 --> 04:19.280
<b>I still don't like it.</b>

04:19.280 --> 04:21.910
<b>Even if it's for her family's sake...</b>

04:23.550 --> 04:26.250
<b>We can't leave everything
on her shoulders, can we?</b>

04:27.040 --> 04:27.660
<b>Say...</b>

04:28.390 --> 04:30.040
<b>Where is she, anyway?</b>

04:31.370 --> 04:36.500
<b>We enhanced persons are merely
expendable parts for Gundams.</b>

04:36.500 --> 04:38.930
<b>I'd say he was the lucky one.</b>

04:43.530 --> 04:44.590
<b>Aren't you scared?</b>

04:46.330 --> 04:48.970
<b>You should just forget all this and run.</b>

04:48.970 --> 04:50.900
<b>Like she should have done.</b>

04:52.170 --> 04:54.150
<b>I am... scared.</b>

04:54.670 --> 04:56.480
<b>But I...</b>

04:56.480 --> 04:58.470
<b>the things on my wish list...</b>

04:58.470 --> 05:01.240
<b>At first, they were just things
Mom suggested I do,</b>

05:01.240 --> 05:03.900
<b>and for some reason,
I went along with them.</b>

05:04.390 --> 05:06.080
<b>But now...</b>

05:06.080 --> 05:08.750
<b>It's not because someone
told me to... I want to do this.</b>

05:08.750 --> 05:10.740
<b>I want to do this.</b>

05:11.270 --> 05:13.920
<b>Ericht... and my mom...</b>

05:13.920 --> 05:15.510
<b>I want to stop them.</b>

05:25.320 --> 05:26.880
<b>I envy you...</b>

05:28.410 --> 05:29.390
<b>Never mind.</b>

05:29.890 --> 05:31.100
<b>Shall we go?</b>

05:31.100 --> 05:32.140
<b>Right.</b>

05:35.500 --> 05:38.270
<b>There's one more thing...</b>

05:38.800 --> 05:40.450
<b>that I want to do.</b>

05:41.800 --> 05:45.530
<b>The Assembly League fleets
have failed in their second wave attack.</b>

05:46.010 --> 05:50.740
<b>For unclear reasons,
Quiet Zero is also inactive now.</b>

05:50.740 --> 05:53.790
<b>We've done what we can to buy time, but...</b>

05:53.790 --> 05:56.550
<b>Has President Miorine
come out of her room yet?</b>

05:57.330 --> 05:59.010
<b>She's...</b>

06:01.280 --> 06:02.130
<b>What is it?</b>

06:02.130 --> 06:05.680
<b><i>A Space Assembly League Inspector
is requesting a meeting.</i></b>

06:05.680 --> 06:06.930
<b>The League?</b>

06:06.930 --> 06:12.020
<b><i>He also says a student from Asticassia
wants to see President Miorine.</i></b>

06:12.020 --> 06:15.510
<b>I'll arrange for an option unit
from Burion.</b>

06:15.510 --> 06:16.860
<b>Thank you!</b>

06:17.460 --> 06:18.850
<b>You're welcome.</b>

06:18.850 --> 06:23.220
<b>We'll be ready to test
the Calibarn shortly.</b>

06:23.220 --> 06:25.160
<b>You'd better make it a brief talk.</b>

06:25.160 --> 06:26.160
<b>Right!</b>

06:26.160 --> 06:27.530
<b>Suletta Mercury!</b>

06:28.860 --> 06:30.200
<b>Mr. Guel?</b>

06:30.200 --> 06:31.570
<b>Mr. Guel!</b>

06:32.560 --> 06:34.000
<b>This way.</b>

06:38.560 --> 06:41.050
<b>She's my fianceé now.</b>

06:41.050 --> 06:43.300
<b>Do you think I'll let you see her?</b>

06:43.650 --> 06:46.840
<b>I want to have a straight talk with her.</b>

06:47.370 --> 06:49.750
<b>With Ms. Miorine. Heart to heart.</b>

06:51.120 --> 06:53.970
<b>In that case, shall we duel over it?</b>

06:55.740 --> 06:58.100
<b>If you lose, you'll give up on Miorine.</b>

06:58.880 --> 06:59.890
<b>What will it be?</b>

07:02.330 --> 07:03.390
<b>I'll do it!</b>

07:03.800 --> 07:04.940
<b>Let's...</b>

07:05.430 --> 07:06.310
<b>duel!</b>

07:09.430 --> 07:12.080
<b>Whoever scores the first hit wins.</b>

07:12.080 --> 07:12.980
<b>Deal?</b>

07:13.600 --> 07:14.580
<b>Yes.</b>

07:15.350 --> 07:18.370
<b>Victory is never decided
by one's social position, alone.</b>

07:18.860 --> 07:21.080
<b>Nor by one's skill, alone.</b>

07:21.080 --> 07:22.710
<b>The result itself...</b>

07:22.710 --> 07:23.930
<b>...is the only truth!</b>

07:24.340 --> 07:26.000
<b>Fix release!</b>

07:24.340 --> 07:26.000
<b>Fix release!</b>

07:46.370 --> 07:47.860
<b>You win.</b>

07:51.220 --> 07:52.330
<b>Follow me.</b>

07:52.330 --> 07:53.500
<b>Th...</b>

07:54.810 --> 07:55.910
<b>Thank you very much!</b>

07:57.890 --> 08:00.330
<b>What a fool I am.</b>

08:08.700 --> 08:11.180
<b>Ms. Miorine... It's me, Suletta.</b>

08:13.670 --> 08:15.220
<b>Sorry for showing up so suddenly.</b>

08:17.460 --> 08:20.620
<b>I'm going to Quiet Zero.</b>

08:22.550 --> 08:26.880
<b>I'll meet with Ericht and
talk to my mom one more time.</b>

08:26.880 --> 08:29.020
<b>I'll ask them to stop Quiet Zero.</b>

08:30.650 --> 08:36.500
<b>But I've relied on Mom and Ericht
for everything, all this time.</b>

08:36.500 --> 08:40.940
<b>Making this choice alone is...
really scary.</b>

08:45.310 --> 08:46.250
<b>I can't.</b>

08:46.740 --> 08:47.860
<b>Ms. Miorine?</b>

08:49.400 --> 08:52.460
<b>I can't give you a convenient pep talk.</b>

08:53.240 --> 08:56.180
<b>You have to decide on your own.</b>

08:56.840 --> 09:01.640
<b>Because of me, so many people
were injured and killed.</b>

09:02.370 --> 09:04.940
<b>Pulling you away from your mother, too...</b>

09:05.500 --> 09:06.510
<b>It was all...</b>

09:07.990 --> 09:09.410
<b>a mistake.</b>

09:12.720 --> 09:16.030
<b>I've made mistakes, too.</b>

09:16.880 --> 09:20.650
<b>I've killed people... at Plant Quetta.</b>

09:21.270 --> 09:22.910
<b>And Ms. Sophie.</b>

09:23.980 --> 09:27.340
<b>I told myself it was
for everyone's protection...</b>

09:27.880 --> 09:29.840
<b>that it was the right thing to do...</b>

09:31.150 --> 09:32.390
<b>But...</b>

09:32.390 --> 09:35.220
<b>when the school was in trouble,</b>

09:35.220 --> 09:38.600
<b>and we were desperately
doing recovery work...</b>

09:38.600 --> 09:39.600
<b>I realized something.</b>

09:40.660 --> 09:44.070
<b>Whether it was right or wrong,</b>

09:44.620 --> 09:47.440
<b>what I've done can't be taken back.</b>

09:48.380 --> 09:52.670
<b>Even if there's nothing to gain,
I have to move forward.</b>

09:54.640 --> 09:58.360
<b>I don't want to... make any more mistakes.</b>

09:59.140 --> 10:01.600
<b>I've only made it this far...</b>

10:01.600 --> 10:03.700
<b>because I met you, Ms. Miorine.</b>

10:05.230 --> 10:07.360
<b>Nothing about that was a mistake.</b>

10:18.870 --> 10:19.930
<b>Someday...</b>

10:21.330 --> 10:24.600
<b>come with me... to Earth.</b>

10:25.740 --> 10:30.710
<b>I'm not strong enough to
face what I've done by myself.</b>

10:31.400 --> 10:34.980
<b>But I can't turn away from it, either.</b>

10:37.470 --> 10:40.370
<b>May I... open the door?</b>

10:40.370 --> 10:41.530
<b>No.</b>

10:44.890 --> 10:46.450
<b>I'll go on my own.</b>

10:47.530 --> 10:49.040
<b>I'll open it myself.</b>

11:43.660 --> 11:45.960
<b><i>The D-index has exceeded 90.</i></b>

11:45.960 --> 11:48.990
<b><i>Recovery complete.
All systems reactivated.</i></b>

11:49.760 --> 11:51.020
<b>Our objective is...</b>

11:51.500 --> 11:53.040
<b>Plant Quetta.</b>

12:01.800 --> 12:04.070
<b>I'm sorry, everyone.</b>

12:04.520 --> 12:06.740
<b>We didn't come here for you.</b>

12:08.650 --> 12:09.730
<b>Go on.</b>

12:10.480 --> 12:13.200
<b>Your father woke up, didn't he?</b>

12:18.000 --> 12:18.800
<b>Right...</b>

12:20.450 --> 12:23.940
<b>It's still difficult for him to speak.</b>

12:26.290 --> 12:29.380
<b>I... won't run.</b>

12:29.380 --> 12:32.640
<b>Not from the company,
or from the Gundam's curse.</b>

12:32.640 --> 12:36.310
<b>So I won't allow you
to give up and die, either!</b>

12:36.730 --> 12:37.950
<b>You lousy father!</b>

12:40.710 --> 12:45.720
<b>Plant Quetta</b>

13:12.720 --> 13:15.330
<b>They seem to have beaten us to it.</b>

13:15.330 --> 13:18.650
<b>In that case, let's pay a visit....</b>

13:19.060 --> 13:21.670
<b>to Delling Rembran himself.</b>

13:22.980 --> 13:27.950
<b>At present, Quiet Zero's data storm
deployment level is only at 60%.</b>

13:28.360 --> 13:33.970
<b>That's why Prospera Mercury has to go
to Plant Quetta to recover certain units.</b>

13:33.970 --> 13:37.230
<b>Once it's fully completed...</b>

13:37.230 --> 13:42.880
<b>It can deploy a data storm capable
of covering the entire Earth Sphere, yes?</b>

13:42.880 --> 13:47.320
<b>We've stationed a defensive fleet
around the head office front, but...</b>

13:47.320 --> 13:51.320
<b>The only machines that can move
in the data storm are Gundams, right?</b>

13:51.320 --> 13:55.290
<b>You've got to be kidding me.
At score 8, you'll die instantly.</b>

13:55.600 --> 14:00.590
<b>The Pharact was never designed
to withstand such a high score load.</b>

14:00.590 --> 14:03.880
<b>Can't we use the Schwarzette
by rewriting its specifications?</b>

14:03.880 --> 14:05.380
<b>There's not enough time.</b>

14:05.380 --> 14:06.550
<b>Too late...</b>

14:06.550 --> 14:11.800
<b><i>The Demi Barding's option unit
has a switchable cockpit space.</i></b>

14:11.800 --> 14:15.100
<b><i>If you add a control system
that doesn't use Permet links...</i></b>

14:15.100 --> 14:17.720
<b>...you can operate it
without being overridden.</b>

14:17.720 --> 14:20.440
<b>That's like driving a car blindfolded!</b>

14:20.440 --> 14:21.850
<b>It'll never work!</b>

14:21.850 --> 14:24.270
<b>It's the only option we have.</b>

14:24.270 --> 14:25.610
<b>Do we have an NTPS?</b>

14:25.610 --> 14:27.720
<b>I've prepared one, but...</b>

14:27.720 --> 14:29.150
<b>are you serious?</b>

14:29.150 --> 14:30.220
<b>Yes.</b>

14:30.800 --> 14:33.240
<b>We're going to go
straight into Quiet Zero.</b>

14:33.240 --> 14:36.830
<b>I have a few ideas about
the codes to shut it down.</b>

14:36.830 --> 14:41.020
<b>I'll do what I can to prevent
the Assembly League from interfering.</b>

14:41.020 --> 14:44.670
<b>Your job will be to draw the attention
of Aerial and the Gundnodes.</b>

14:44.670 --> 14:46.000
<b>Can you do it?</b>

14:46.000 --> 14:47.170
<b>Yes!</b>

14:47.170 --> 14:48.640
<b>Is this really what you want?</b>

14:49.070 --> 14:50.510
<b>Mr. Guel?</b>

14:50.510 --> 14:52.680
<b>If Suletta operates the Gundam...</b>

14:53.530 --> 14:55.200
<b>I decided on my own.</b>

15:03.590 --> 15:04.770
<b>Listen up.</b>

15:04.770 --> 15:08.780
<b>If we deem the situation hopeless,
we'll hand over the units immediately.</b>

15:08.780 --> 15:11.030
<b>You're all students.</b>

15:11.030 --> 15:13.610
<b>Let the adults take responsibility.</b>

15:14.670 --> 15:15.990
<b>Thanks!</b>

15:17.130 --> 15:21.290
<b><i>Emergency evacuation orders
from Lagrange 4 </i></b>

15:21.290 --> 15:25.880
<b><i> are now in effect for
all Benerit Group employees.</i></b>

15:27.020 --> 15:28.320
<b>I barely recognize you.</b>

15:29.000 --> 15:31.010
<b>Is that thanks to the Mercurian Miss?</b>

15:31.010 --> 15:34.870
<b>Shaddiq... you and I
have both committed sins.</b>

15:35.320 --> 15:37.100
<b>But we aren't through yet.</b>

15:37.100 --> 15:39.290
<b>We have to make up for them.</b>

15:40.240 --> 15:41.640
<b>Are you able to do it?</b>

15:41.640 --> 15:45.250
<b>Even if I'm not, I've decided
to keep moving forward.</b>

15:46.370 --> 15:48.900
<b>So why don't we make a trade?</b>

15:48.900 --> 15:50.130
<b>A trade?</b>

15:50.710 --> 15:52.530
<b>You won't regret it.</b>

15:52.530 --> 15:55.100
<b>Believe in me!</b>

16:09.070 --> 16:12.170
<b>I can do the switching test at any time.</b>

16:12.170 --> 16:13.950
<b>Thank you, Rouji!</b>

16:15.530 --> 16:16.510
<b>Not at all...</b>

16:16.510 --> 16:18.970
<b>Chuchu! Time for final adjustments!</b>

16:18.970 --> 16:20.370
<b>You got it, Nika!</b>

16:20.820 --> 16:24.350
<b>I'm amazed you could find
an old museum piece like this.</b>

16:24.350 --> 16:28.610
<b>Well, it helps that I'm so used
to working with junk.</b>

16:28.610 --> 16:30.860
<b>You're really going?</b>

16:30.860 --> 16:33.860
<b>I can't let Nika and Chuchu
face danger by themsel--</b>

16:33.860 --> 16:36.030
<b>Want some motion-sickness pills?</b>

16:37.680 --> 16:38.490
<b>A tomato...</b>

16:38.840 --> 16:40.240
<b>You brought it here?</b>

16:43.050 --> 16:46.210
<b>NR400... Anesidora.</b>

16:47.220 --> 16:48.290
<b>That's...</b>

16:48.290 --> 16:51.880
<b>It means "she who sends
gifts from the earth."</b>

16:53.490 --> 16:56.660
<b>It was Mr. Rouji who looked it up.</b>

16:57.070 --> 16:59.510
<b>And this was in the genetic code.</b>

16:59.820 --> 17:01.220
<b>Words?</b>

17:03.280 --> 17:07.770
<b>I'm sure your mom
embedded them into the code.</b>

17:22.060 --> 17:24.160
<b>We'll grow some more of them.</b>

17:26.010 --> 17:26.920
<b>Right!</b>

17:30.960 --> 17:32.880
<b><i>Permet link established.</i></b>

17:32.880 --> 17:36.210
<b><i>3... 2... 1...</i></b>

17:40.150 --> 17:42.050
<b><i>Listen, Suletta.</i></b>

17:42.490 --> 17:46.980
<b><i>To avoid being overridden,
you have to clear score 5.</i></b>

17:46.980 --> 17:52.900
<b>The Calibarn doesn't have any filters
to reduce feedback from the data storm.</b>

17:52.900 --> 17:58.340
<b>But it can produce and maintain a higher
score with the same amount of Permet.</b>

17:58.760 --> 18:03.390
<b>Since your body is nearly identical
to Ericht's, you have strong resistance.</b>

18:03.800 --> 18:07.810
<b>But unlike her,
you can't coexist with the data storm.</b>

18:08.220 --> 18:10.560
<b><i>Promise not to push it too far.</i></b>

18:10.560 --> 18:13.400
<b>Thank you very much, Ms. Belmeria...</b>

18:14.230 --> 18:17.280
<b><i>for letting me do as I please.</i></b>

18:18.060 --> 18:19.630
<b><i>Please begin.</i></b>

18:20.030 --> 18:21.320
<b>Commence calling.</b>

18:21.740 --> 18:24.330
<b>Roger. Commencing call.</b>

18:26.410 --> 18:31.600
<b><i>Raising score. Internal Permet
influx values, plus five points.</i></b>

18:32.130 --> 18:33.130
<b>Calling!</b>

18:38.250 --> 18:39.740
<b><i>Suletta!</i></b>

18:41.460 --> 18:43.110
<b><i>Keep going, please!</i></b>

18:44.130 --> 18:46.350
<b>Raising score, plus five points.</b>

18:48.930 --> 18:49.940
<b>Calling!</b>

19:06.070 --> 19:07.700
<b>Score 5...</b>

19:08.120 --> 19:09.220
<b>cleared.</b>

19:21.800 --> 19:24.530
<b><i>I'm coming, Ericht!</i></b>

19:27.760 --> 19:30.040
<b><i>Data storm interference waves detected.</i></b>

19:30.040 --> 19:33.290
<b><i>Reactivation of Permet reactor confirmed.</i></b>

19:33.290 --> 19:35.230
<b>It's begun.</b>

19:35.640 --> 19:38.740
<b>Miorine Rembran's trying
to pull off her first feat.</b>

19:39.150 --> 19:42.010
<b>Let's see what she can do.</b>

19:48.870 --> 19:50.640
<b><i>Permet pattern detected.</i></b>

19:50.640 --> 19:54.810
<b>Object has penetrated
boundary surface of data storm space.</b>

20:02.500 --> 20:03.970
<b><i>The Calibarn...!</i></b>

20:20.860 --> 20:23.210
<b>Please let me through!</b>

20:36.290 --> 20:39.610
<b>So... it's Suletta, after all.</b>

20:52.180 --> 20:53.370
<b><i>The battle has begun.</i></b>

20:53.370 --> 20:54.860
<b>We should go too.</b>

21:01.480 --> 21:03.030
<b><i>The Schwarzette?!</i></b>

21:07.750 --> 21:09.530
<b><i>Stop it!</i></b>

21:09.530 --> 21:11.580
<b><i>Who the hell is piloting it?!</i></b>

21:15.120 --> 21:18.600
<b><i>Are you still obsessed
with that woman, Brother?</i></b>

21:20.230 --> 21:21.670
<b><i>Lauda?</i></b>

21:58.740 --> 22:00.060
<b><i>Ericht!</i></b>

22:03.250 --> 22:04.550
<b>What are you doing here...</b>

22:05.140 --> 22:06.650
<b>Suletta?</b>

22:07.790 --> 22:09.180
<b><i>I came to stop you!</i></b>

